df","rendered_turn_sha256":"12d1376b128cfbe6650f81b8a680a342f6627781e642ab5f52c7f16055122b25","session_date":"2023-10-29","session_datetime":"2023-10-29T10:49:00","session_id":"session_27","session_index":27,"source_sha256":"d441f5991ec5ce825c43b13c253fce19c0e0b17559d817d0022c4e1da85ec84b","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":6},{"dia_id":"D27:7","global_turn_index":477,"locator":"[S27T7]","raw_turn_sha256":"744ed2e8c379db525c2e481ea0901f92cecce1b21ab97449517e12f7c1869adc","rendered_turn_sha256":"51aeeab0e7b91e53e5fdb78abd7d2abe13a2bfcd042f8bb1c8231bc2322a2a8b","session_date":"2023-10-29","session_datetime":"2023-10-29T10:49:00","session_id":"session_27","session_index":27,"source_sha256":"30c34ece33a52fae451414d1a9eba944d5f82b36c8917c735160ae684b63a1a0","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":7},{"dia_id":"D27:8","global_turn_index":478,"locator":"[S27T8]","raw_turn_sha256":"b135bd0c46057df40105f74eb692701b3a0540ac6f5d5562afcbf9b7aec2e770","rendered_turn_sha256":"f606909ecff493e4f4a08f06313193e5c5d71094557380dce629e97f777ca52e","session_date":"2023-10-29","session_datetime":"2023-10-29T10:49:00","session_id":"session_27","session_index":27,"source_sha256":"bf5d5c6cae6cfc25b62834fcaa6c2fada18301c3ca733f6efa7258b8d221342b","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":8}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s2","store_snapshot_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","text":"Calvin: Hey Dave! Since we last talked, I went to a networking event to meet more artists. So cool! The people I met will help me build up my fan base. Super excited about what it could lead to. You? Anything new since we last spoke?\n[S27T1] (dia_id: D27:1)\n\nDave: Hey Calvin! That's cool that you've been networking with other artists. Nice! I've been getting into photography recently. I've seen some amazing places and taken some great shots. Would you like to see them?\n[S27T2] (dia_id: D27:2)\n\nCalvin: Yeah, show me what you got!\n[S27T3] (dia_id: D27:3)\n\nDave: Look at this magnificent sunset I captured on camera. It's truly breathtaking to witness such beautiful sunsets! The sky looks like it's on fire!\n[Image caption: a photo of a city skyline at sunset with a clock tower]\n[S27T4] (dia_id: D27:4)\n\nCalvin: Wow, that view looks awesome! What city is it? Have you taken any good pictures lately?\n[S27T5] (dia_id: D27:5)\n\nDave: That's Boston, Cal! Check this out, I took this picture last month, and got a great shot - it was stunning!\n[Image caption: a photography of a clock tower in a city with buildings]\n[S27T6] (dia_id: D27:6)\n\nCalvin: Wow, that pic is amazing! In your last photo, is that the clock tower? I was there a few years back, it's such a beautiful city. You're so talented, Dave!\n[S27T7] (dia_id: D27:7)\n\nDave: Thanks, Calvin! Your kind words mean a lot. Yep, that's the clock tower in the last photo. I snapped it at sunset and the colors were stunning. Photography helps me capture and appreciate the beauty of nature. It's been an awesome creative outlet and I'm loving it.\n[S27T8] (dia_id: D27:8)","text_sha256":"87f94ad9da94674206877ee3b91271b8471063d15e1b065da3fa0760974b0892","timestamp":"2023-10-29T10:49:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"557de20bfece3f61e9afe8e8305a3e15c2c6f1474569dc78a6580fbb1490e746","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D8:1"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":13,"line_start":12,"source_locators":["[S8T1]"],"text_sha256":"f57977b13730cd3fe15a47cfe3f8970a3f6621fa68ffb288b00d39c4d9c2470f"},{"dia_ids":["D8:2"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":17,"line_start":15,"source_locators":["[S8T2]"],"text_sha256":"eef0e75e7346a422793144ef52e1a50cb60de7890d52efa011a97a2606a42429"},{"dia_ids":["D8:3"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":21,"line_start":19,"source_locators":["[S8T3]"],"text_sha256":"cea925a109268e3f72a097ae22c4a5d679bcf3bb9546c4d534349894ed852e09"},{"dia_ids":["D8:4"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":24,"line_start":23,"source_locators":["[S8T4]"],"text_sha256":"2521a9c8b8cd2ffc14061a3f971ea457be3c59f50cc711376679d950bf8c1c4b"},{"dia_ids"